ubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gitnexus/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;GitNexus turns a codebase into a knowledge graph that coding agents can query for exact structural information, such as which functions call a given piece of code or which services depend on an API, instead of relying on embedding-based search that can miss or misjudge relationships. It ships with agent skills for exploring, debugging, impact analysis, and refactoring, and can flag when a change in one repository will break something in another before that change is merged.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Cal.com</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cal-com/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cal-com/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Letta</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/letta/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/letta/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Ragas</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/ragas/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/ragas/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Transifex</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/transifex/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/transifex/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Archbee</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/archbee/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/archbee/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Crowdin</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/crowdin/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/crowdin/</guid><description/></item><item><title>CVAT</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cvat/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cvat/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Drata</title><link>https